OL,3,GNEWSAPupils win behind-the-scenes tour
OL,4,Aof Parliament
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren at an Essex primary school
OL,7,Fwere given a special tour around the
OL,8,FPalace of Westminster, after winning a
OL,9,Fprize during UK Parliament week.
OL,11,FThe Year Four pupils from Cherry Tree
OL,12,FAcademy in Colchester sat on the green
OL,13,Fbenches of St Stephen's Hall and took
OL,14,Fpart in their own debate, and discussed
OL,15,Fideas around smoking bans and littering
OL,16,Fenforcement.
OL,18,FEight-year-old Ben said: "Parliament is
OL,19,Fgood because rules are made here, so
OL,20,Fthat no crime can be going on in the
OL,21,Fworld."
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
